# Deterministic route: menu, New Game, then fixed say counts. Every shot waits for a hold (no clicking) plus a settle time.
# Ops: cmd TEXT | wait TOKEN SECS | settle SECS | shot NAME [volatile] | note TEXT | quit
# `wait` looks at progress lines after the last `cmd`. `shot ... volatile` means the frame holds a video or an animation:
# it is compared and reported but does not fail the gate.
cmd auto on
cmd click on
wait menu True 180
cmd click off
settle 3
shot 01-menu
cmd start
after_start
cmd advance-to 12
wait advance-done 240
settle 3
shot 02-say-12
cmd advance-to 40
wait advance-done 360
settle 3
shot 03-say-40
quit
